{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "John Meets Sandra", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Sandra: A Corporate Trainer ", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describing People", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you describe people's appearance and personality, you use adjectives.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you use adjectives to describe someone's hair, they go in a particular order.<br/> Start with:<br/>I/You have ...<br/>He/She's got ...", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Order of Adjectives</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Length\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Style\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Color\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Noun\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"long\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"curly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"brown\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hair\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"short\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"wavy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"blonde\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hair\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"medium\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"straight\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"black\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hair\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">These are adjectives you can use when you talk about someone's personality.</span><br/> cheerful, friendly, outgoing, kind, sweet, thoughtful, generous, quiet, moody, shy, mean<br/><br/>You use the structure<br/><br/>She/He is ...<br/>You/They are ...", "type": "text"}, {"content": "She's tall and slender. She's got long, curly, brown hair. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "He's outgoing, kind and thoughtful.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Past Tense & Past Continuous Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished.<br/>You use the Past Continuous tense to talk about events or an action that was happening at a time in the past.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular.<br/> Regular verbs end in <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"italic\">-ied</span>.<br/> Irregular verbs change in different ways.<br/> For questions in the past, you use the auxiliary <span class=\"italic\">did</span> followed by the verb in the base form, like <span class=\"italic\">Did you ask ... ?</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">Did</span> is the past form of <span class=\"italic\">to do</span>.<br/><br/>For Past Continuous, we add was/were + verb\u201cing\u201d to verbs.<br/>Some verbs need a change to the last letter to add \u201cing\u201d.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" talk\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"talked\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were talking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"walk\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"walked\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were walking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"focus\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"focused\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were focusing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lead\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"led\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were leading\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"return\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"returned\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were returning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were having\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "When she walked by my office, I was talking on the phone.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When she was talking, I just focused on her face. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When she had free time, I was leading a tour. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When I returned from the tour, she was having dinner.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to confess", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to tell a secret truth to someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have to confess I really like Sandra.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to describe someone.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to be attracted to", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to have an interest or romantic feeling towards someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am attracted to Sandra's brown eyes and long hair.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "presenter", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the person who makes a presentation in front of a group", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sandra was the presenter of the workshop.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "conversation", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a talk you have with someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to have a longer conversation with her.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "hazel", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a light green-brown color", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She has beautiful hazel eyes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "height", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the measure of how high something or someone is", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She is the same height as I am.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "glossy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "describes a shiny smooth look", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like her full glossy lips.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn5le07ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of someone you're attracted to.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "List, then describe their physical features and personality.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a short e-mail to a friend describing what the person looks like and what their personality is like.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say how you feel about them.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about someone I'm attracted to.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe someone's physical features and personality.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write an e-mail to a friend describing my feelings.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le07ob05re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le07ob05re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"italic\">On March 4, at 9:10 PM, John Harris &#60;John.Harris@mail.com&#62; wrote:</span><br>\nHi, Peter. I have to confess I'm attracted to Sandra, the lovely presenter for that professional development workshop. She works as the Director of Operations for US Tours on the ship."}, {"image": "engenn5le07ob05re2img06.jpg", "time": "12400", "id": 2, "text": "The presentation was helpful, but when she was talking, I was just focusing on her face. She has long, straight, brown hair and nice hazel eyes. She has full glossy lips, a slender face and a beautiful smile. She's slim and about my height. She seems really friendly, too."}, {"image": "engenn5le07ob05re2img05.jpg", "time": "32000", "id": 3, "text": "When she walked by my office yesterday, I was talking on the phone. Then when she had free time, I was leading a tour. By the time I returned, she had a business dinner. I will try to have a longer conversation with her sometime."}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le07ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le07ob05re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "text", "contents": [{"value": "engenn5le07ob05re5aud01", "type": "audio"}], "id": 2}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "text", "contents": [{"value": "engenn5l